/* ===========================================================================
   Nxeon v4 — hero.

   Palette, radii and BUTTONS are the customer portal's own, copied out of
   app/globals.css rather than eyeballed off a screenshot. The brief is
   explicit: "Match the button styling and visual language from the existing
   NXEON customer portal... Do not introduce a completely different button
